{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "* **At the door:**\n  **Person in Ball Gown (P1):** *\"Oh my goodness, these heels are going to ruin my feet—but I *had* to wear them. You look… surprisingly comfortable in those sweats, by the way. Almost like you’re not even trying.\"*\n  **Person in Sweats (P2):** *\"Yeah, well, comfort’s my priority tonight. If I start dancing, I don’t want to worry about my zipper popping open or my hair flying everywhere.\"* (adjusts backward cap) *\"You’re gonna freeze, though—this dress is like a bottle of champagne out here.\"*\n\n* **Midway through the event (loud music, crowd moving):**\n  **P1:** *\"I swear, I’ve never seen so many people in fancy clothes just… standing around like this. Do you think they’re all waiting for the *real* party to start?\"* (sips champagne) *\"…Or did I overestimate how ‘exclusive’ this was?\"*\n  **P2:** *\"Nah, they’re just window-shopping for drama. Meanwhile, I’m over here debating whether to grab another snack from the buffet. You want to split a sliders? Or are you still on that ‘I only eat air’ vibe?\"* (holds up half-eaten mini burger) *\"I lied—it’s already taken.\"*\n\n* **On the way home (taxi ride, P1 adjusting gloves, P2 sprawled out):**\n  **P1:** *\"Okay, next time, *I’m* the one in sweatpants and you can be the one enduring judgmental glares. At least you didn’t have to explain to anyone why your dress matches your lipstick *and* your heels.\"*\n  **P2:** *\"Deal. But only if you promise to teach me how to do your hair like that—no offense, but yours looks way better than mine when I’m *not* wearing a crown.\"* (grins) *\"…Also, my socks are still on backward, and I don’t care.\"*", "logprobs": [{"token": "*", "logprob": -0.15976127982139587}, {"token": " **", "logprob": -0.7903324961662292}, {"token": "At", "logprob": -0.9366381168365479}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0011485177092254162}, {"token